#. The bonus excludes holders with scaled base stats.
#. Distinguish the variant from the battle tier.
msgctxt "page:Doubles Attack when held by Cubone, Marowak or Alolan Marowak. No bonus if the holder's base stats are scaled by the rebalanced variant or Smogon Scalemons."
msgid "Doubles Attack when held by Cubone, Marowak or Alolan Marowak. No bonus if the holder's base stats are scaled by the rebalanced variant or Smogon Scalemons."
msgstr "Verdoppelt den Angriff, wenn Tragosso, Knogga oder Alola-Knogga das Item trägt. Kein Bonus, wenn die Basiswerte des Trägers durch die neu ausbalancierte Variante oder Smogon Scalemons skaliert werden."

#. The unevolved holder retains its bonus in the variant.
